<description>&lt;p&gt;A drone strike hit the Amiet market in Abyei, killing dozens, while coordinated cattle raids in Warrup state killed at least 72 people. Fighting continues in Upper Nile, where the Chollo King was airlifted to Juba and the Upper Nile Deputy Governor visited Baliet County after the deadly Adong attack, and Machar disputes Bol Mel’s claims over the Nasir attack. The SSPDF and SPLA-IO forces clashed in Wij-Panyikang, Upper Nile, and the UN commission warned that the peace deal is being dismantled. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOV3ItRHNWY0x2Snh6OGliQmY3bUNIMWVjajB6WkktcllJWnF2M1ZaRmFJN0staEhqbnBjMFA5QjRYcjBUZ3VCaFRwZ0xjUEpmdzZ1dUFsbXlVdmlDYUE0dktHNXM2ZnFoQm44QlF5MEs2NXdabmRKZkFKNjNzWXhnVnREM3UyQ3pfOExudEJmWDZIWHBfaTNUM3cwUFJRU2N2VGc0aHR2OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ohchr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPd0c5LU9CVHcwenhtcFJNLXhBd2Vqd3JrU2MzYjh3aTRwdHpqeUMwMXFCcmsyWXVNMjNqVEVQeWR1d2kzcGZUWUFlRE5xVFl3dTBUOWg4VUNRQ1l2Z3BLNDhSLXlYOGlEaFJrNWhvTmJhdzJObUhmbnV4WHBFckVncEl5UTRuOTN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Apa.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOalVhclhXRjNzTlhEbnlnQjN6cUFMNEF4TmlGTDBGVUs0alZna0RJUzFENnJUNS04QlN5ek9iSnNVNlFaVnVVdV9RTXZ2X1NpQW5mUUVhcjA5a2x2Um5oRGNyNGlIZEtUY0o0ZVc3Vl8yMXBtTkVJU18tekVyNHdPNnFqWDNPM0Jj?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQVUVDcE41Q3gxMklWYm5jZkxDNVpzZEo0clNBZXk5UjB4bGJJR2gyaWZaWDNHVVV5bGNGS0ozZ3I5QWlqaEpBU0JWeHE3